  m_Name: 2_FragmentShaderData
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptableObjects.ShaderData
  shaderName: 02 - Plasma Ball
  shaderId: 1
  shaderDescription: 'Fragment

    Each pixel computes its position in polar coordinates,
    which naturally orients the effect radially outward. A domain warping technique
    is then applied: the angular coordinate is offset by layered noise before a final
    noise sample is taken, causing the tendrils to curve and branch as they reach
    away from the center'
